For marked edge ab and hop destination c in N(a) excluding b, the primitive output has

\[
\Delta q_a=\sigma-1,\quad\Delta q_b=-\sigma,\quad
\Delta q_c=1,\qquad
\Delta E=\sigma e_{ab}-e_{ac}.                              \tag{9}
\]

Its test charge is

\[
r_f(a;b,c,\sigma)=(f_c-f_a)-\sigma(f_b-f_a).                 \tag{10}
